{"seq":1,"slug":"automl-systems","title":"AutoML 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/automl-systems","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"automl-系统\">AutoML 系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AutoML（Automated Machine Learning）是自动化机器学习全流程或部分流程的技术体系。它的目标是降低 ML 开发的门槛和成本，让数据科学家从繁琐的超参调优和架构搜索中解放出来，专注于更高价值的工作——问题定义、数据理解和业务解读。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[自动特征工程]&#10;    B --&gt; C[自动模型选择]&#10;    C --&gt; D[自动超参优化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[自动集成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[最优模型]\">graph LR\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[自动特征工程]\n    B --&gt; C[自动模型选择]\n    C --&gt; D[自动超参优化]\n    D --&gt; E[自动集成]\n    E --&gt; F[最优模型]</pre><p>AutoML 系统的自动化程度和覆盖范围各不相同，从简单的超参数搜索到端到端的全自动 ML 流水线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>AutoML 层面</th>\n<th>自动化内容</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超参优化</td>\n<td>学习率、层数等超参搜索</td>\n<td>Optuna, Ray Tune</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征工程</td>\n<td>特征生成、选择、转换</td>\n<td>Featuretools, AutoFeat</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型选择</td>\n<td>从候选模型库选择最优</td>\n<td>Auto-sklearn, FLAML</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构搜索</td>\n<td>自动设计网络结构</td>\n<td>NAS, DARTS</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>数据到部署全自动</td>\n<td>AutoGluon, H2O</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"超参数优化算法\">超参数优化算法</h2><p>超参数优化（Hyperparameter Optimization, HPO）是 AutoML 中最成熟的技术领域。核心挑战是在高维超参数空间中用最少的试验次数找到最优配置。</p>\n<p>贝叶斯优化是当前最高效的 HPO 策略。它维护一个代理模型（Surrogate Model）来近似超参数到性能指标的映射关系，通过采集函数（Acquisition Function）在&quot;探索&quot;（尝试信息不足的区域）和&quot;利用&quot;（聚焦已知有潜力的区域）之间平衡。TPE（Tree-structured Parzen Estimator）是 Optuna 使用的默认贝叶斯优化算法，它通过建模&quot;好参数&quot;和&quot;差参数&quot;的条件密度来指导搜索。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import optuna&#10;&#10;def create_model(trial):&#10;    n_layers = trial.suggest_int(&quot;n_layers&quot;, 2, 8)&#10;    layers = []&#10;    in_features = 784&#10;&#10;    for i in range(n_layers):&#10;        out_features = trial.suggest_int(f&quot;n_units_l{i}&quot;, 32, 512, log=True)&#10;        layers.append(torch.nn.Linear(in_features, out_features))&#10;        layers.append(torch.nn.ReLU())&#10;&#10;        dropout = trial.suggest_float(f&quot;dropout_l{i}&quot;, 0.1, 0.5)&#10;        layers.append(torch.nn.Dropout(dropout))&#10;        in_features = out_features&#10;&#10;    layers.append(torch.nn.Linear(in_features, 10))&#10;    return torch.nn.Sequential(*layers)&#10;&#10;def objective(trial):&#10;    model = create_model(trial)&#10;    lr = trial.suggest_float(&quot;lr&quot;, 1e-5, 1e-1, log=True)&#10;    optimizer_name = trial.suggest_categorical(&quot;optimizer&quot;, [&quot;Adam&quot;, &quot;SGD&quot;, &quot;AdamW&quot;])&#10;    optimizer = getattr(torch.optim, optimizer_name)(model.parameters(), lr=lr)&#10;&#10;    accuracy = train_and_evaluate(model, optimizer, epochs=20)&#10;    return accuracy&#10;&#10;study = optuna.create_study(direction=&quot;maximize&quot;)&#10;study.optimize(objective, n_trials=100, n_jobs=4)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n_layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    in_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 784</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_layers):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        out_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n_units_l</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.append(torch.nn.Linear(in_features, out_features))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.append(torch.nn.ReLU())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dropout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_float(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dropout_l</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.append(torch.nn.Dropout(dropout))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        in_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out_features</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    layers.append(torch.nn.Linear(in_features, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> create_model(trial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_float(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_categorical(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"optimizer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Adam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SGD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AdamW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> getattr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(torch.optim, optimizer_name)(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accuracy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_and_evaluate(model, optimizer, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accuracy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.create_study(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"maximize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study.optimize(objective, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多保真度优化（Multi-Fidelity Optimization）利用低成本的近似评估来加速搜索。Hyperband 算法将计算预算分配为多个 Bracket，每个 Bracket 中启动大量配置但只训练少量 epoch，根据中间结果逐轮淘汰表现差的配置。ASHA（Asynchronous Successive Halving）是 Hyperband 的异步版本，可以在分布式环境中并行运行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[初始 81 个配置] --&gt; B[每个训练 1 epoch]&#10;    B --&gt; C[保留 Top 27]&#10;    C --&gt; D[每个训练 3 epochs]&#10;    D --&gt; E[保留 Top 9]&#10;    E --&gt; F[每个训练 9 epochs]&#10;    F --&gt; G[保留 Top 3]&#10;    G --&gt; H[每个训练 27 epochs]&#10;    H --&gt; I[最优配置]\">graph TB\n    A[初始 81 个配置] --&gt; B[每个训练 1 epoch]\n    B --&gt; C[保留 Top 27]\n    C --&gt; D[每个训练 3 epochs]\n    D --&gt; E[保留 Top 9]\n    E --&gt; F[每个训练 9 epochs]\n    F --&gt; G[保留 Top 3]\n    G --&gt; H[每个训练 27 epochs]\n    H --&gt; I[最优配置]</pre><h2 id=\"神经架构搜索\">神经架构搜索</h2><p>神经架构搜索（Neural Architecture Search, NAS）自动设计神经网络结构，是 AutoML 中最具挑战性也最有潜力的方向。NAS 的搜索空间包括层类型（卷积、池化、全连接）、连接方式（跳跃连接、密集连接）、通道数、核大小等。</p>\n<p>早期的 NAS（如 NASNet）使用强化学习控制器从搜索空间中采样架构，评估每个架构需要完整训练一次模型，计算成本极高（数千 GPU 天）。后续的高效 NAS 方法大幅降低了搜索成本。</p>\n<p>DARTS（Differentiable Architecture Search）将离散的架构搜索转化为连续优化问题。它在搜索空间中为每条候选边分配一个可学习的权重，通过梯度下降同时优化架构权重和模型权重。搜索完成后，保留权重最大的操作形成最终架构。DARTS 只需要单 GPU 几天即可完成搜索。</p>\n<p>One-Shot NAS 训练一个包含所有候选架构的超网络（Supernet），搜索时从超网络中采样子网络并评估性能。由于子网络共享超网络的权重，评估不需要重新训练，搜索效率极高。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class SearchSpace:&#10;    OPS = {&#10;        &quot;conv_3x3&quot;: lambda C: nn.Conv2d(C, C, 3, padding=1),&#10;        &quot;conv_5x5&quot;: lambda C: nn.Conv2d(C, C, 5, padding=2),&#10;        &quot;max_pool&quot;: lambda C: nn.MaxPool2d(3, stride=1, padding=1),&#10;        &quot;skip&quot;: lambda C: nn.Identity(),&#10;        &quot;none&quot;: lambda C: Zero(),&#10;    }&#10;&#10;class MixedOp(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, C):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.ops = nn.ModuleList([&#10;            SearchSpace.OPS[name](C) for name in SearchSpace.OPS&#10;        ])&#10;        self.weights = nn.Parameter(torch.randn(len(self.ops)))&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        probs = F.softmax(self.weights, dim=0)&#10;        return sum(p * op(x) for p, op in zip(probs, self.ops))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchSpace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    OPS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"conv_3x3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C: nn.Conv2d(C, C, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"conv_5x5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C: nn.Conv2d(C, C, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"max_pool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C: nn.MaxPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"skip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C: nn.Identity(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C: Zero(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MixedOp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, C):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ops </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ModuleList([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            SearchSpace.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OPS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[name](C) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SearchSpace.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OPS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Parameter(torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ops)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        probs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.softmax(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p, op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(probs, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ops))</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NAS 方法</th>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>搜索成本</th>\n<th>搜索质量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NASNet</td>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>数千 GPU 天</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>研究基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DARTS</td>\n<td>梯度下降</td>\n<td>1-4 GPU 天</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>通用搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>One-Shot</td>\n<td>超网络采样</td>\n<td>1 GPU 天</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快速原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EfficientNet</td>\n<td>复合缩放</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>架构缩放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自动特征工程\">自动特征工程</h2><p>自动特征工程（Automated Feature Engineering）自动化特征的生成、选择和转换过程。对于结构化数据（表格数据），特征工程通常是决定模型性能的关键因素，好的特征可以让简单模型超越复杂模型。</p>\n<p>Featuretools 是开源的自动特征工程库，它通过深度特征合成（Deep Feature Synthesis, DFS）自动从关系型数据中生成特征。DFS 将原始数据中的实体关系和聚合操作组合为多层特征：一阶特征是对原始列的简单变换，二阶特征是通过实体关系进行聚合后再变换，以此类推。</p>\n<p>特征选择自动化同样重要。当自动特征工程生成了数百甚至数千个特征后，需要自动筛选出对模型性能有正向贡献的特征子集。常用方法包括基于重要性的选择（如 Random Forest Feature Importance）、基于相关性的过滤（去除高度相关的冗余特征）和包装法（如 Recursive Feature Elimination）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[原始特征] --&gt; B[自动生成]&#10;    B --&gt; C[候选特征池]&#10;    C --&gt; D[重要性排序]&#10;    D --&gt; E[冗余过滤]&#10;    E --&gt; F[交叉验证]&#10;    F --&gt; G[最优特征集]\">graph TB\n    A[原始特征] --&gt; B[自动生成]\n    B --&gt; C[候选特征池]\n    C --&gt; D[重要性排序]\n    D --&gt; E[冗余过滤]\n    E --&gt; F[交叉验证]\n    F --&gt; G[最优特征集]</pre><h2 id=\"端到端-automl-框架\">端到端 AutoML 框架</h2><p>端到端 AutoML 框架将特征工程、模型选择、超参优化和模型集成统一为一个自动化流水线。用户只需提供数据和目标列，框架自动完成剩余所有工作。</p>\n<p>AutoGluon 是 AWS 开源的端到端 AutoML 框架，在表格数据上表现尤为出色。它的核心策略是多模型集成——同时训练多种模型（LightGBM、XGBoost、CatBoost、神经网络、K-近邻等），然后通过多层 Stacking 将它们的预测集成为最终输出。AutoGluon 在多个 Kaggle 竞赛数据集上取得了与人类专家相当的成绩。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from autogluon.tabular import TabularPredictor&#10;&#10;predictor = TabularPredictor(&#10;    label=&quot;target&quot;,&#10;    eval_metric=&quot;roc_auc&quot;,&#10;    problem_type=&quot;binary&quot;,&#10;).fit(&#10;    train_data=train_df,&#10;    time_limit=3600,&#10;    presets=&quot;best_quality&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;predictions = predictor.predict(test_df)&#10;leaderboard = predictor.leaderboard(test_df)&#10;feature_importance = predictor.feature_importance(test_df)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autogluon.tabular </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TabularPredictor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predictor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TabularPredictor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"roc_auc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    problem_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"binary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).fit(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    train_data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_df,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    time_limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    presets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"best_quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictor.predict(test_df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">leaderboard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictor.leaderboard(test_df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">feature_importance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictor.feature_importance(test_df)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>H2O AutoML 是另一个成熟的端到端方案，支持表格数据和时序数据。FLAML（Fast and Lightweight AutoML）由微软研究院开发，专注于低计算预算下的高效搜索，适合资源受限的场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>强项</th>\n<th>适用数据</th>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>部署支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AutoGluon</td>\n<td>表格数据</td>\n<td>表格/图像/文本</td>\n<td>多模型 Stacking</td>\n<td>AWS 原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H2O AutoML</td>\n<td>企业级</td>\n<td>表格/时序</td>\n<td>搜索 + 集成</td>\n<td>多平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLAML</td>\n<td>低预算高效</td>\n<td>表格</td>\n<td>经济型搜索</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Auto-sklearn</td>\n<td>学术标准</td>\n<td>表格</td>\n<td>贝叶斯优化</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((AutoML 系统))&#10;    超参优化&#10;      贝叶斯优化&#10;      Hyperband&#10;      多保真度&#10;    架构搜索&#10;      DARTS 可微搜索&#10;      One-Shot NAS&#10;      搜索空间设计&#10;    特征工程&#10;      深度特征合成&#10;      自动特征选择&#10;      冗余过滤&#10;    端到端框架&#10;      AutoGluon&#10;      H2O AutoML&#10;      FLAML\">mindmap\n  root((AutoML 系统))\n    超参优化\n      贝叶斯优化\n      Hyperband\n      多保真度\n    架构搜索\n      DARTS 可微搜索\n      One-Shot NAS\n      搜索空间设计\n    特征工程\n      深度特征合成\n      自动特征选择\n      冗余过滤\n    端到端框架\n      AutoGluon\n      H2O AutoML\n      FLAML</pre><ul>\n<li>AutoML 通过自动化降低 ML 开发门槛，从超参优化到端到端全流程自动化均有成熟方案</li>\n<li>贝叶斯优化 + Hyperband 是当前最高效的超参搜索策略组合</li>\n<li>NAS 通过可微搜索和超网络技术将架构设计成本从数千 GPU 天降到单 GPU 天</li>\n<li>自动特征工程对表格数据场景尤为重要，好的特征集可以让简单模型超越复杂模型</li>\n<li>端到端 AutoML 框架已能在标准数据集上达到与人类专家相当的性能</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AutoML 系统","id":"automl-系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"超参数优化算法","id":"超参数优化算法"},{"level":2,"text":"神经架构搜索","id":"神经架构搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"自动特征工程","id":"自动特征工程"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端 AutoML 框架","id":"端到端-automl-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可观测性与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/observability-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"ML 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/automl-and-platforms/ml-platforms"}}